# React Meta orchestration

## Toolchain

- **Node 24.x** + **FDK 10.x** before **`fdk run`** / **`fdk validate`** / **`fdk pack`**.
- Installing or upgrading **Node/FDK**: **fw-setup** skill—not this skill.

## Platform semantics

- **manifest**, **modules**, **requests.json ↔ manifest sync**, **OAuth**, **`renderData`**, **events**, **complexity ≤ 7**, **async/await**, **unused parameters**: **fw-app-dev** (or **app-dev** skill) is authoritative.
- **React Meta** skills only add: **metaConfig**, **JSX/bundler** conventions, **HTML shells**, **migration** from vanilla UI.

## Validation

- An app is not "done" until **`fdk validate`**: **0 platform + 0 lint** (same bar as **fw-app-dev**).
